<%# locals: (title:, heading:, count_heading:, rows:, people: false, link_year: nil) %>
<%#
  One "where requests come from" leaderboard: positions or the rangers behind
  them. Both shapes are the same two columns, so they share this partial.

  count_heading: the corrections lists count review decisions and the missing
  lists count requests -- see _decision_card. The column has to say which.

  link_year: the year to open a ranger's timesheet at, or nil for their default.
  Passed rather than read off @year because it is only right for the missing
  lists: those are scoped by the shift's year, which is the year the person
  timesheet page also reads. The corrections lists are scoped by the year the
  decision was made, and a 2020 decision about a 2019 entry would land the
  reader on an empty 2020 timesheet.

  striped: rows are ranked and nearly all short, and the stripe is what keeps a
  reader on the right line when the counts run down to ties.
%>
<div class="card-standard p-4">
  <h3 class="heading-title text-heading mb-2"><%= title %></h3>

  <% if rows.empty? %>
    <p class="text-base text-stone-muted">None this year.</p>
  <% else %>
    <%= ui_table full_width: true, striped: true do |t| %>
      <%= t.header do %>
        <%= t.heading heading %>
        <%= t.heading count_heading, right: true %>
      <% end %>
      <%= t.body do %>
        <% rows.each do |row| %>
          <%= t.row do %>
            <%= t.row_header do %>
              <% if people %>
                <%# person_timesheets_readable?, not can_view_person_page?: the
                    link goes to the ranger's timesheet, and Timesheet
                    Management is admitted there while being kept out of
                    /person/:id. Gating on the person-page roles handed this
                    page's largest non-admin audience dead text instead of a
                    link that works for them. %>
                <% if row.person && person_timesheets_readable? %>
                  <%= callsign_link row.person,
                                    person_timesheets_path(row.person, year: link_year) %>
                <% else %>
                  <%= person_display_name row.person, row.person_id %>
                <% end %>
              <% else %>
                <%= row.label %>
              <% end %>
            <% end %>
            <%= t.cell number_with_delimiter(row.total), right: true %>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</div>
